msgid "Tides Today Tides and Weather"
msgstr "Tides Today Marees et meteo"

msgid "Display a saved Tides Today tide and weather widget."
msgstr "Affiche un widget Tides Today enregistre avec marees et meteo."

msgid "Saved widget"
msgstr "Widget enregistre"

msgid "Select a saved widget"
msgstr "Selectionnez un widget enregistre"

msgid "Create your first saved widget in Tides Today."
msgstr "Creez votre premier widget enregistre dans Tides Today."

msgid "Loading Tides Today data..."
msgstr "Chargement des donnees Tides Today..."

msgid "Select a country"
msgstr "Selectionnez un pays"

msgid "Select a region"
msgstr "Selectionnez une region"

msgid "Select a location"
msgstr "Selectionnez un lieu"

msgid "Choose a language first"
msgstr "Choisissez d'abord une langue"

msgid "Choose a country first"
msgstr "Choisissez d'abord un pays"

msgid "Choose a region first"
msgstr "Choisissez d'abord une region"

msgid "We could not load data from Tides Today. Please try again."
msgstr "Impossible de charger les donnees depuis Tides Today. Veuillez reessayer."

msgid "Delete this saved widget?"
msgstr "Supprimer ce widget enregistre ?"

msgid "Choose a location to preview the widget."
msgstr "Choisissez un lieu pour previsualiser le widget."

msgid "Loading live preview..."
msgstr "Chargement de l'apercu en direct..."

msgid "We could not build the live preview right now."
msgstr "Impossible de generer l'apercu en direct pour le moment."

msgid "Tides Today widget preview"
msgstr "Apercu du widget Tides Today"

msgid "Insert a saved Tides Today tide and weather widget."
msgstr "Inserez un widget Tides Today enregistre avec marees et meteo."

msgid "Choose which saved widget to embed on the front end."
msgstr "Choisissez le widget enregistre a integrer sur le site."

msgid "Create a saved widget in Tides Today before using this block."
msgstr "Creez un widget enregistre dans Tides Today avant d'utiliser ce bloc."

msgid "Saved widgets are managed in the Tides Today admin screen."
msgstr "Les widgets enregistres sont geres dans l'ecran d'administration Tides Today."

msgid "Tides Today"
msgstr "Tides Today"

msgid "All widgets"
msgstr "Tous les widgets"

msgid "Add Widget"
msgstr "Ajouter un widget"

msgid "Tides Today Tides and Weather cannot finish loading:"
msgstr "Tides Today Marees et meteo ne peut pas terminer son chargement :"

msgid "You do not have permission to manage Tides Today widgets."
msgstr "Vous n'avez pas l'autorisation de gerer les widgets Tides Today."

msgid "Create reusable tide and weather widgets for shortcodes, sidebars, and the block editor."
msgstr "Creez des widgets reutilisables de marees et meteo pour les shortcodes, les barres laterales et l'editeur de blocs."

msgid "Tides Today logo"
msgstr "Logo Tides Today"

msgid "The Tides Today Tides and Weather Plugin allows you to add tide times and weather, for over 8,000 locations world-wide."
msgstr "L'extension Tides Today Marees et meteo vous permet d'ajouter les horaires de maree et la meteo pour plus de 8 000 lieux dans le monde."

msgid "Saved widgets"
msgstr "Widgets enregistres"

msgid "There are no Tides Today widgets yet. Create one to get started"
msgstr "Il n'existe encore aucun widget Tides Today. Creez-en un pour commencer"

msgid "Create a widget"
msgstr "Creer un widget"

msgid "Create widget"
msgstr "Creer un widget"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nom"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Langue"

msgid "Location"
msgstr "Lieu"

msgid "Shortcode"
msgstr "Code court"

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Actions"

msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Modifier"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Supprimer"

msgid "Edit widget"
msgstr "Modifier le widget"

msgid "Back to widgets"
msgstr "Retour aux widgets"

msgid "Unique name"
msgstr "Nom unique"

msgid "This name is used in shortcode, block, and widget pickers."
msgstr "Ce nom est utilise dans les selecteurs de shortcodes, de blocs et de widgets."

msgid "English"
msgstr "Anglais"

msgid "French"
msgstr "Francais"

msgid "Country"
msgstr "Pays"

msgid "Region"
msgstr "Region"

msgid "Days to show"
msgstr "Nombre de jours"

msgid "Display options"
msgstr "Options d'affichage"

msgid "Include title"
msgstr "Inclure le titre"

msgid "Include map"
msgstr "Inclure la carte"

msgid "Include weather"
msgstr "Inclure la meteo"

msgid "Include base styles"
msgstr "Inclure les styles de base"

msgid "Custom CSS"
msgstr "CSS personnalise"

msgid "If filled, this CSS is printed inline with the widget on the front end."
msgstr "Si ce champ est renseigne, ce CSS est affiche en ligne avec le widget sur le site."

msgid "Weather unit"
msgstr "Unite meteo"

msgid "Celsius"
msgstr "Celsius"

msgid "Fahrenheit"
msgstr "Fahrenheit"

msgid "Height unit"
msgstr "Unite de hauteur"

msgid "Meters"
msgstr "Metres"

msgid "Feet"
msgstr "Pieds"

msgid "Update widget"
msgstr "Mettre a jour le widget"

msgid "Save widget"
msgstr "Enregistrer le widget"

msgid "Live preview"
msgstr "Apercu en direct"

msgid "The preview updates after you choose a location and whenever you change the widget options."
msgstr "L'apercu se met a jour apres le choix d'un lieu et chaque fois que vous modifiez les options du widget."

msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Utilisation"

msgid "Use this shortcode anywhere shortcodes are supported:"
msgstr "Utilisez ce shortcode partout ou les shortcodes sont pris en charge :"

msgid "The same saved widget will also appear in the classic Widgets screen and in the Gutenberg block dropdown."
msgstr "Le meme widget enregistre apparaitra aussi dans l'ecran classique des widgets et dans la liste deroulante des blocs Gutenberg."

msgid "You do not have permission to save Tides Today widgets."
msgstr "Vous n'avez pas l'autorisation d'enregistrer les widgets Tides Today."

msgid "Please complete every required field before saving."
msgstr "Veuillez remplir tous les champs obligatoires avant d'enregistrer."

msgid "Widget names must be unique."
msgstr "Les noms des widgets doivent etre uniques."

msgid "The selected country is no longer available."
msgstr "Le pays selectionne n'est plus disponible."

msgid "The selected region is no longer available."
msgstr "La region selectionnee n'est plus disponible."

msgid "The selected location is no longer available."
msgstr "Le lieu selectionne n'est plus disponible."

msgid "You do not have permission to delete Tides Today widgets."
msgstr "Vous n'avez pas l'autorisation de supprimer les widgets Tides Today."

msgid "Saved Tides Today widget not found."
msgstr "Widget Tides Today enregistre introuvable."

msgid "Unknown proxy script requested."
msgstr "Le script proxy demande est inconnu."

msgid "Tides Today Tides and Weather requires PHP %1$s or newer. You are running %2$s."
msgstr "Tides Today Marees et meteo exige PHP %1$s ou plus recent. Vous utilisez %2$s."

msgid "Tides Today Tides and Weather requires WordPress %1$s or newer. You are running %2$s."
msgstr "Tides Today Marees et meteo exige WordPress %1$s ou plus recent. Vous utilisez %2$s."

msgid "The PHP JSON extension is required."
msgstr "L'extension PHP JSON est requise."

msgid "Either the PHP cURL or OpenSSL extension is required to fetch Tides Today data over HTTPS."
msgstr "L'extension PHP cURL ou OpenSSL est requise pour recuperer les donnees Tides Today via HTTPS."

msgid "Tides Today returned invalid JSON."
msgstr "Tides Today a renvoye un JSON invalide."

msgid "The Tides Today service could not be reached."
msgstr "Le service Tides Today est inaccessible."

msgid "Tides Today returned an unexpected response."
msgstr "Tides Today a renvoye une reponse inattendue."

msgid "A complete preview location was not provided."
msgstr "Un lieu d'apercu complet n'a pas ete fourni."

msgid "Widget saved successfully."
msgstr "Widget enregistre avec succes."

msgid "Widget deleted successfully."
msgstr "Widget supprime avec succes."

msgid "Something went wrong."
msgstr "Un probleme est survenu."

msgid "Visit Tides Today"
msgstr "Visiter Tides Today"

msgid "Find on Facebook"
msgstr "Retrouver sur Facebook"

msgid "Follow on X"
msgstr "Suivre sur X"

msgid "Subscribe on Youtube"
msgstr "S'abonner sur YouTube"

msgid "Follow on Instagram"
msgstr "Suivre sur Instagram"
